  "DARV.talk.GREGTHESPIRE-GREG_THE_SPIRE.1-0r.ancient": "Still keeping at it, I see... Let’s see if we can upgrade ya!",
  "DARV.talk.GREGTHESPIRE-GREG_THE_SPIRE.2-0.ancient": "I’ve been holding on to your friend’s uhh... um.\nNevermind nevermind!!",
  "DARV.talk.GREGTHESPIRE-GREG_THE_SPIRE.2-0.next": "Question",
