  "DARV.talk.GREGTHESPIRE-GREG_THE_SPIRE.2-2.ancient": "My scrappy scrapper, forget I said all that!",
  "NEOW.talk.GREGTHESPIRE-GREG_THE_SPIRE.0-0.ancient": "[sine]...construct.. what...\n....have you.. become...?[/sine]",
